"text\": \"Hebbar made his professional debut for Inter Milan on August 31, 2014, in a Serie A match against Torino F.C.\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"He played for Inter Milan's first team for three seasons, making a total of 25 appearances and scoring 5 goals.\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"In 2017, Hebbar transferred to S.S.D.\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"Pro Sesto Calcio, where he has since become a key player for the team.\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"During the 2018-2019 season, he scored 12 goals in 30 appearances, helping the team secure a promotion to Serie C.\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"Studies and References\"}, {\"id\": \"s15\", \"text\": \"A study published in the Journal of Sports Science and Medicine in 2019 analyzed the performance of Hebbar during his time at Inter Milan.\"}, {\"id\": \"s16\", \"text\": \"The study found that Hebbar's speed and agility were significantly higher than the average Serie A player, making him an effective attacking threat.\"}, {\"id\": \"s17\", \"text\": \"[1]\"}, {\"id\": \"s18\", \"text\": \"In an interview with Italian sports newspaper La Gazzetta dello Sport in 2020, Hebbar discussed his decision to join S.S.D.\"}, {\"id\": \"s19\", \"text\": \"Pro Sesto Calcio, stating that he was attracted to the team's \\\"ambitious project\\\" and \\\"strong team spirit.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s20\", \"text\": \"[2]\"}, {\"id\": \"s21\", \"text\": \"A report by Italian football website TuttoMercatoWeb in 2020 listed Hebbar as one of the top 10 players in Serie C, citing his \\\"exceptional dribbling skills\\\" and \\\"clinical finishing ability.\\\"\"}]}"
